# Integrity-checked policy files. The SHA-256 sidecar is computed over the exact bytes on
# disk, and the broker refuses to load a manifest that does not match it (every tool then
# returns unknown-or-revoked-tool). These files must therefore have the same bytes in every
# checkout, whatever core.autocrlf is set to.
#
#   manifest.json         stored LF in the repository, always checked out CRLF: the form the
#                         sidecar is computed over. The UTF-8 BOM is part of the content.
#   manifest.json.sha256  never converted.
policy/manifest.json        text eol=crlf
policy/manifest.json.sha256 -text
